# ppx_forbid configuration for octez_manager_ui_views
#
# Belt-and-suspenders Eio enforcement for the views library.
# The dune stanza for octez_manager_ui_views excludes eio/eio_main/eio_posix
# from its dependency list. This ppx_forbid rule adds a compile-time message
# that explains exactly how to fix a violation, since linker errors alone are
# not actionable enough.
#
# Remediation: Move I/O into a *_scheduler.ml or *_actions.ml file and pass
# pre-computed values as immutable snapshots to the view instead.

module Eio "Eio is forbidden in view modules — move I/O into a *_scheduler.ml or *_actions.ml file and pass pre-computed values to the view instead."
